{"id":"659943","name":"黄皮蒸排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659943/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄皮","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄皮用盐水浸泡清洗。","img":"images/659943/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"排骨斩块后清水泡发出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/659943/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"黄皮剪开去核，放入排骨里。","img":"images/659943/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉。","img":"images/659943/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽。","img":"images/659943/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉抓抓拌均匀。","img":"images/659943/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量花生油抓匀锁住水份。","img":"images/659943/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"排骨放入碗中，隔水上锅高压锅15分钟即可。","img":"images/659943/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅一阵很香的果香味。","img":"images/659943/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659943/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659943/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659943/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}